      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 12
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "*Additionally, known streamers would receive those kinds of attacks regardless on whether or not they are streaming right now, making it even more important that it becomes a separate setting. Discord has a streamer mode and separate privacy settings for when people can add you and I think it is very useful like that to prevent random requests regardless of your mode",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
