      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d6ac3d319a45a329c545086|full_name}: It is a better solution, but it also is one that's outside the scope of this particular feature. We'll likely add seperate controls later, but for now, this is how Streamer mode will likely work.\nIf two people with streamer mode enabled want to friend each other... well, yeah, that's an (assumedly extremely rare) edge case that you kinda just have to deal with. We're fine with that being how it works for the moment.\ntl;dr: yes, you have a point, but we decided to circle back around to that later when we have time",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
