      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Fair enough. If this is being addressed later on, I'm fine with it, I jus see it being a problem for me since I usually do quietly send friend requests and don't always feel comfortable approaching someone to ask. In the meantime I guess I jus, ask more often or use my avatar to communicate it. (Maybe adding the friend request symbol as an emoji could be a temporary workaround for mutes? Wouldn't really be abusable I think either)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
