      "statusChangeID": "6058f9c15418412aced85dd6",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "After review, we aren't going to make a change to this behavior at this time.\nThese changes are intended to prevent avenues of attack. Opening up the changes a bit opens a surface we're not comfortable with in addition to complicating the feature.\nIf you have Streamer mode on, you can still send a friend request to others.\nThat being said, we definitely will consider this for future privacy features.",
      "viewerReactions": null
